WEBVTT

00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:03.570
Dad?

00:00:03.940 --> 00:00:07.350
Oh. You came to save Kanna?

00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:09.980
Impressive. For you.

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:16.280
Without psychite, Kanna cannot survive.

00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:18.740
Keiko was the same.

00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:22.520
Where is my mom?

00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:25.170
Keiko is with me.

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:29.040
In a word that is known,
in the sphere of philosophy, as "Idea."

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:30.750
I'm coming after you.

00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:32.460
Just stay there and wait for me.

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:34.230
It's time, I think.

00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:38.350
Not that "time" means anything at all.

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:42.160
Which is a lesson you're
about to learn very well...

00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:01.300
So this is Dela Granto?

00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:10.800
Are these edible?

00:01:14.130 --> 00:01:16.720
If my dad was gonna make me play survivalist,

00:01:16.720 --> 00:01:19.930
he should've said so ahead of time!

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:55.770
"Episode 18: Twilight in Dela Granto"

00:02:53.520 --> 00:02:54.500
Check.

00:02:55.770 --> 00:02:57.040
Activating hall.

00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:04.260
Check. Forced teleport.

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:13.790
How many years has it been since
I've spent so much time in the woods?

00:03:21.930 --> 00:03:25.350
If I use this I won't be able
to get back to Kanna-<i>chan</i>.

00:03:54.120 --> 00:03:56.090
What the hell is this place?

00:03:58.300 --> 00:03:59.720
Help me!

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:01.410
Who's there?

00:04:03.180 --> 00:04:04.300
No!

00:04:05.290 --> 00:04:06.300
Stay away!

00:04:09.890 --> 00:04:11.140
A monster?

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:13.490
And a girl?

00:04:16.860 --> 00:04:17.810
Hold it!

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:28.960
I'm glad it was weaker than it looked.

00:04:29.360 --> 00:04:30.300
You okay?

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:35.540
What's your name? Where did you come from?

00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:40.930
Can you not talk?

00:04:42.880 --> 00:04:46.530
Huh? I thought I heard screaming, though...

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:51.720
Well, I'm not sure what to do.

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:55.480
But right now, you're
my only hope in this world.

00:04:58.230 --> 00:05:01.840
I'm Takuya. Ta. Ku. Ya.

00:05:04.700 --> 00:05:06.670
I'm not scary at all!

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:08.450
See?

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:16.220
You laughed.

00:05:33.180 --> 00:05:36.290
Does your name start with 
any of these letters?

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:41.720
A. I. U. E. O.

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:49.560
Okay... Ka. Ki. Ku. Ke. Ko.

00:05:51.910 --> 00:05:54.250
This'll take a while.

00:05:57.410 --> 00:05:58.790
Um...

00:05:58.790 --> 00:06:00.990
Your name is Sayless.

00:06:01.420 --> 00:06:05.700
And you don't know where you're from,
or about Sakaimachi or psychite.

00:06:06.220 --> 00:06:07.030
Right?

00:06:08.680 --> 00:06:11.910
So now there's two lost
people instead of one, huh?

00:06:32.870 --> 00:06:34.290
A desert?

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:40.630
What is it?

00:06:41.790 --> 00:06:43.090
That way?

00:06:46.510 --> 00:06:47.920
A house?

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:49.820
There may be someone home!

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:51.950
Let's go.

00:07:00.270 --> 00:07:03.420
Hello? Is anyone home?

00:07:06.820 --> 00:07:08.480
Excuse me...

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:15.220
Hey, Sayless.

00:07:16.660 --> 00:07:18.640
Is this room normal?

00:07:21.830 --> 00:07:23.750
I see...

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:27.500
So this world's civilization
isn't that primitive, huh?

00:07:40.060 --> 00:07:40.940
Watch out!

00:07:43.310 --> 00:07:44.610
Throw down your weapon.

00:07:50.740 --> 00:07:52.990
Who are you?

00:07:52.990 --> 00:07:57.990
If anything, I'd like to know
who I am in this world.

00:07:57.990 --> 00:07:59.550
Did you come from the imperial city?

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:03.370
I don't think so, unless you mean Sakaimachi.

00:08:05.420 --> 00:08:06.750
Take off your clothes.

00:08:06.750 --> 00:08:09.550
Wow, usually I'd have 
to buy you dinner first.

00:08:10.010 --> 00:08:11.630
Disarm.

00:08:12.420 --> 00:08:15.940
Very perceptive... You noticed my magnum.

00:08:16.300 --> 00:08:17.200
Mag...?

00:08:18.140 --> 00:08:19.670
Do it, now!

00:08:19.670 --> 00:08:20.570
Or...

00:08:26.730 --> 00:08:27.630
Hey!

00:08:27.940 --> 00:08:29.190
Are you okay?

00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:38.910
You're awake.

00:08:38.910 --> 00:08:41.200
What did you do to me?

00:08:41.470 --> 00:08:43.080
Nothing.

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:46.350
You'd peed yourself so I took
care of that, but nothing else.

00:08:49.550 --> 00:08:50.920
Hang on!

00:08:50.920 --> 00:08:53.470
Sayless did it all, not me!

00:09:03.510 --> 00:09:05.990
I'm sorry for pointing
my sword at you like that.

00:09:07.270 --> 00:09:09.360
My name is Ailia.

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:12.950
I am a knight, guarding the border
at the order of the Divine Emperor.

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:15.680
The border?

00:09:15.680 --> 00:09:18.900
The boundary that separates
Dela Granto from the rest of the world.

00:09:19.340 --> 00:09:23.160
I defeat the monsters that appear here.

00:09:23.160 --> 00:09:26.330
So you're a border guard.

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:28.110
More or less, yes.

00:09:36.630 --> 00:09:38.800
Why did you come to Dela Granto, Takuya?

00:09:39.300 --> 00:09:41.700
I came to find psychite.

00:09:42.060 --> 00:09:43.310
Have you ever heard of it?

00:09:44.020 --> 00:09:46.040
Psychite?

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:48.040
I'm afraid not...

00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:51.110
Is it a jewel to give that girl?

00:09:51.110 --> 00:09:52.980
No.

00:09:52.980 --> 00:09:54.780
I'm giving the stone to another girl.

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:05.000
The monsters coming across
the border grow in number

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:06.460
and get more violent by the day.

00:10:08.170 --> 00:10:11.300
It's a sign of Mother Nature's wrath,
which is visited upon us once every 400 years.

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:13.840
Four hundred years again?

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:15.730
That's a number I hear a lot.

00:10:17.630 --> 00:10:22.060
The wrath of Mother Nature shows
the people of Dela Granto no mercy.

00:10:23.220 --> 00:10:25.350
Great rains. Floods.

00:10:25.640 --> 00:10:28.520
Earthquakes. Lands turned to desert.

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:31.190
You can't do anything
about a natural disaster.

00:10:31.190 --> 00:10:32.320
There is a way.

00:10:32.770 --> 00:10:36.150
In five years, a ritual will
be done to purify this world,

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:37.990
and a god shall manifest.

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:38.890
A god?

00:10:39.570 --> 00:10:42.410
The priestess who becomes the vessel

00:10:42.410 --> 00:10:46.940
of the god sacrifices her physical
abilities in exchange for divine power.

00:10:47.430 --> 00:10:51.580
Some lose the ability to walk.
Others, their voice.

00:10:52.670 --> 00:10:55.040
Are you talking about Sayless?

00:10:55.630 --> 00:10:57.720
I thought so as well.

00:10:57.720 --> 00:11:00.470
But if she was a priestess,

00:11:00.470 --> 00:11:03.100
how did she get all the way
here from the imperial city?

00:11:03.100 --> 00:11:05.350
She crossed the desert...

00:11:05.640 --> 00:11:10.550
Crossing the Rafaelo Desert under
Melgio's hateful gaze is impossible.

00:11:11.310 --> 00:11:12.610
Completely impossible.

00:11:16.110 --> 00:11:17.440
We're back!

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:22.270
You can cook, huh?

00:11:22.610 --> 00:11:24.990
Wonderful! Let's eat!

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:28.070
Let's eat!

00:11:40.340 --> 00:11:41.750
The priestess is gone?

00:11:42.340 --> 00:11:45.610
We've confirmed she was
on the dais as of this morning.

00:11:46.390 --> 00:11:48.800
Divine Emperor, what shall we do?

00:11:51.350 --> 00:11:54.640
The royal guards must form
a team to track her down.

00:11:55.750 --> 00:11:58.540
I shall consult the will of Mother.

00:11:59.110 --> 00:11:59.970
Yes, sir!

00:12:09.370 --> 00:12:12.370
This "kendo" of yours isn't
meant for real combat, is it?

00:12:12.370 --> 00:12:14.960
I've never held a real sword before!

00:12:15.380 --> 00:12:18.210
Don't let your guard down in Dela Granto!

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:23.820
All the knights on the border
except me have died.

00:12:25.800 --> 00:12:28.430
What lies beyond the desert?

00:12:28.430 --> 00:12:29.570
The imperial city.

00:12:30.050 --> 00:12:31.930
And on the way, the quarries.

00:12:32.640 --> 00:12:34.140
The quarries?

00:12:34.140 --> 00:12:38.520
I don't know the details.
But that's where they mine the holy stones.

00:12:38.520 --> 00:12:41.220
Are they different from psychite?

00:12:41.570 --> 00:12:42.490
I don't know.

00:12:43.030 --> 00:12:43.990
But...

00:12:44.610 --> 00:12:48.620
I know. You can't cross the desert, right?

00:12:49.240 --> 00:12:49.970
Yes.

00:12:58.590 --> 00:12:59.680
I'll handle it.

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:33.250
Ailia, are you okay?

00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:37.330
Yes. And after I just told you not
to let your guard down, too...

00:13:37.710 --> 00:13:40.240
What happened? That's not like you.

00:13:42.300 --> 00:13:44.930
I remembered my little sister.

00:13:46.050 --> 00:13:47.250
Sister?

00:13:47.760 --> 00:13:48.710
Amanda...

00:13:49.220 --> 00:13:51.800
The only family I have left now.

00:13:52.770 --> 00:13:55.890
She was different from me
in every way imaginable.

00:13:56.690 --> 00:13:58.430
She ran away from home.

00:13:59.770 --> 00:14:02.280
Who knows what she's doing now...

00:14:07.280 --> 00:14:08.320
Ailia?

00:14:08.320 --> 00:14:09.820
I knew it. You're sick...

00:14:09.820 --> 00:14:11.870
Struggling against it won't help.

00:14:12.530 --> 00:14:16.780
The disease that eats away at me is fate.

00:14:24.300 --> 00:14:26.420
We'll go to the forest later.

00:14:26.420 --> 00:14:27.160
Okay.

00:14:30.050 --> 00:14:31.800
Is there something on my face?

00:14:31.800 --> 00:14:33.900
No, you're as pretty as ever.

00:14:34.890 --> 00:14:35.800
I'll be back later.

00:14:55.200 --> 00:14:56.450
What's up?

00:15:01.630 --> 00:15:04.170
You're going over there to pick flowers?

00:15:06.170 --> 00:15:08.840
It's dangerous, so I'll go with you--

00:15:08.840 --> 00:15:11.860
Got one! Wow! It's a fighter!

00:15:11.860 --> 00:15:15.560
Wow! Wow! It's a big one!

00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:17.390
Sayless, wait! Wait!

00:15:23.730 --> 00:15:25.900
Look at the size of it!

00:15:25.900 --> 00:15:27.870
It's a big one!

00:15:31.910 --> 00:15:34.050
Sayless! Behind you!

00:15:37.950 --> 00:15:39.250
Sayless!

00:15:48.920 --> 00:15:51.510
Sayless, run to Takuya!

00:16:09.030 --> 00:16:10.030
Ailia!

00:16:18.040 --> 00:16:19.430
Are you okay?

00:16:25.630 --> 00:16:26.670
I see...

00:16:27.090 --> 00:16:28.500
Sayless...

00:16:28.940 --> 00:16:33.210
You knew I would die today, didn't you?

00:16:40.640 --> 00:16:41.640
Ailia!

00:16:51.150 --> 00:16:53.760
I knew it. You're the priestess.

00:16:55.740 --> 00:16:59.720
Why did you abandon the ritual to come here?

00:17:02.120 --> 00:17:05.360
I want you to save this nation from

00:17:06.530 --> 00:17:08.290
Mother Nature's wrath.

00:17:09.130 --> 00:17:12.590
It's something... only you can do...

00:17:14.720 --> 00:17:16.710
It's what... you must do...

00:17:18.850 --> 00:17:21.460
The wish of all the people...

00:17:36.990 --> 00:17:39.190
What Sayless must do...

00:17:43.410 --> 00:17:45.370
What I must do...

00:17:53.510 --> 00:17:55.970
I'm going to the quarry in the desert.

00:17:56.720 --> 00:17:58.470
To find the psychite.

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:05.520
It's what I must do.

00:18:05.520 --> 00:18:08.030
So do what you must do.

00:18:17.280 --> 00:18:18.570
I'm going alone!

00:18:18.570 --> 00:18:20.320
You won't survive in the desert!

00:18:58.950 --> 00:19:01.000
Did Sayless give up?

00:19:01.450 --> 00:19:04.450
Good... That's what needed to happen.

00:19:11.440 --> 00:19:13.340
No way...

00:19:13.340 --> 00:19:16.560
Damn it!

00:19:27.140 --> 00:19:28.440
Sayless?

00:19:31.100 --> 00:19:32.290
Sayless?

00:19:35.860 --> 00:19:39.280
Don't tell me... She's still in the desert?

00:19:46.450 --> 00:19:47.750
Mother...

00:19:48.250 --> 00:19:52.130
Is what you said a lie?

00:19:53.130 --> 00:19:56.500
No. I believe it...

00:20:04.220 --> 00:20:08.150
Sayless! Sayless!

00:20:09.270 --> 00:20:11.310
Sayless!

00:20:22.450 --> 00:20:23.540
Takuya...

00:20:25.120 --> 00:20:27.140
Where are you, Sayless?

00:20:27.950 --> 00:20:29.580
I'm here.

00:20:31.660 --> 00:20:36.460
The light of life, the light
of Melgio, envelops me...

00:20:38.840 --> 00:20:40.060
Melgio?

00:20:41.970 --> 00:20:43.730
The direction of the sun?

00:20:55.190 --> 00:20:56.410
--I can feel it...

00:20:57.360 --> 00:20:57.770
--Sayless! Sayless! Sayless!
--I can feel it...

00:20:57.770 --> 00:21:05.260
--Sayless! Sayless! Sayless!
--His breath. His voice.

00:21:06.070 --> 00:21:07.210
Sayless!

00:21:15.460 --> 00:21:16.630
Drink, Sayless!

00:21:36.150 --> 00:21:42.160
I heard your voice. It brought me here.

00:21:43.070 --> 00:21:44.240
Takuya...

00:21:46.780 --> 00:21:51.700
My meeting with you was destined by fate...

00:21:51.910 --> 00:21:52.860
Fate?

00:23:35.060 --> 00:23:41.610
"Episode 19:
The Bond Between Parent and Child"

00:23:35.760 --> 00:23:39.040
Episode 19: "The Bond
Between Parent and Child."
